I had long wondered about what the best way to train your pet to steal
things from stores is.  Granted, talking firmly to it is a false rumor, 
but exactly how do you feed it.  I typically stand on the door, and 
throw tripe to them when they stand right next to me (on that space
which is in the shop but free). This seems to work, but I wondered 
whether where the pet was really mattered.

The doggy code is pretty confusing (even as nethack code goes), but 
as far as I can see, whenever the pet eats anything which you once 
held, it becomes better trained, and thus more likely to drop things
it picks up on a square next to you.  So as far as I can tell, 
picking up any corpse, and dropping it, and letting the pet eat
it is just as good as throwing it tripe.  Anyone know for sure?
